                <mxCell id="p2_delta" value="What changed vs today&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Inference moves in-boundary:&lt;br&gt;   Bedrock over PrivateLink,&lt;br&gt;   public egress removed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Agentic retrieval added:&lt;br&gt;   hybrid OpenSearch + reranker,&lt;br&gt;   exposed as one MCP tool.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Trust layer made explicit:&lt;br&gt;   input / output / action&lt;br&gt;   guardrails + eval service.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Human approval becomes&lt;br&gt;   durable: Step Functions task&lt;br&gt;   tokens survive multi-day waits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. Governance is cross-cutting:&lt;br&gt;   entitlements, immutable audit,&lt;br&gt;   prompt + model registry." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8F8;strokeColor=#C62828;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#C62828;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
